  "_commit": {
    "id": "f138676f1bf0dfa5f6a02cefa4b4b96794dbd726",
    "author": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "committer": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "message": "fix: prevent %*%/crossprod temp-table name collisions under a seeded RNG (0.99.9)\n\nFor the body, if you want one:\n\n%*%/crossprod's vector-multiply helpers named their left_join(..., copy =\nTRUE) temp table via dbplyr::unique_table_name(), which draws its \"random\"\nsuffix from R's global RNG rather than an independent source. Under a\ncaller-seeded RNG (needed for reproducible iterative-solver results, since\nirlba also draws its starting vector from the global RNG), repeated calls\ncould regenerate the same name and collide with a still-live temp table,\nsince none of these helpers ever drop theirs.\n",
    "time": 1788992355
  },
